 do samoohon ko milakar nahi, unka fark dekhenge. Riya ke paas paanch choodiyaan hain, Zoya ke paas teen. Riya ke paas kitni zyada hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"dikhao na... picture dikhao"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, choodiyon ki tasveer banwa rahi hoon. Tab tak socho: Riya ke paas paanch choodiyaan hain, Zoya ke paas teen. Riya ke paas kitni zyada hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... चित्र कहाँ है? दिखाओ ना"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tasveer abhi nahi aayi. Main choodiyon ki tasveer banwa rahi hoon. Tab tak socho, Riya ki paanch aur Zoya ki teen choodiyon mein kitni ka fark hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म... 2?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne do kaha. Choodiyon ki tasveer abhi nahi aayi. Ab run wali baat socho: jeetne ke liye saat run chahiye, aur chaar ban gaye. Aur kitne run chahiye?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म... 11?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne gyarah kaha, jaise saat aur chaar jode hon. Par team ko kul saat run chahiye; gyarah to saat se bhi zyada hain. Chaar se paanch, chhah, saat tak kitne kadam hain?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.05451,"tokens":32055},"boards":7,"lastMs":5272,"screen":{"on":"board","texts":["0","4","5","6","7"],"words":"the board shows a number line marked at 4 and 5 and 6 and 7; written on it: 0; 4; 5; 6; 7"},"learner":{"c1-maths-ch05-t02-s1":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i01","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i09","kind":"near_transfer"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"evidence":"Roti aur bus ki kahaniyan sahi"},"c1-maths-ch05-t02-s2":{"read":"not","graded":[{"g":"wrong(c1-maths-ch05-t02-mc-compare-adds)","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i11","kind":"far_transfer"}],"grades":["wrong(c1-maths-ch05-t02-mc-compare-adds)"],"evidence":"Saat aur chaar jodkar gyarah kaha","misconceptions":["c1-maths-ch05-t02-mc-compare-adds"]},"c1-maths-ch05-t02-s3":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i03","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch